      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wakhuluma kubo bonke abakoIsrayeli, kubaphathi bezinkulungwane labamakhulu, lakubahluleli, lakuzo zonke izinduna zakoIsrayeli, lenhloko zezindlu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahamba lalo lonke ibandla, baya endaweni ephakemeyo yokukhonzela eyayiseGibeyoni; ngoba ithente likaNkulunkulu lokuhlangana elalenziwe nguMose inceku yeNkosi enkangala lalilapho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.3.1+1KI.3.2+1KI.3.3+1KI.3.4+1KI.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kho 3:1–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "— Kodwa uDavida wathatha ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kaNkulunkulu eKiriyathiJeyarimi, wawuletha endaweni ayeyilungisele wona, ngoba wayewumisele ithente eJerusalema",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.6.1+2SA.6.2+2SA.6.3+2SA.6.4+2SA.6.5+2SA.6.6+2SA.6.7+2SA.6.8+2SA.6.9+2SA.6.10+2SA.6.11+2SA.6.12+2SA.6.13+2SA.6.14+2SA.6.15+2SA.6.16+2SA.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 6:1–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.13.5+1CH.13.6+1CH.13.7+1CH.13.8+1CH.13.9+1CH.13.10+1CH.13.11+1CH.13.12+1CH.13.13+1CH.13.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Lan 13:5–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "15:25—16:1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi lealtare lethusi elalenziwe nguBezaleli indodana kaUri kaHuri lalikhona lapho phambi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " leNkosi uNkulunkulu; uSolomoni lebandla bayakhuleka khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.38.1+EXO.38.2+EXO.38.3+EXO.38.4+EXO.38.5+EXO.38.6+EXO.38.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 38:1–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wasondela ealtareni lethusi phambi kweNkosi elalingasethenteni lokuhlangana, wanikela phezu kwalo iminikelo yokutshiswa eyinkulungwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalobobusuku uNkulunkulu wabonakala kuSolomoni, wathi kuye: Cela lokho ofisa ukuba ngikunike khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wathi kuNkulunkulu: Wenzele ubaba uDavida umusa omkhulu, wangenza mina ngaba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkosi Nkulunkulu, akugcwalise isithembiso sakho kuDavida ubaba, ngoba ungenze ngaba yinkosi yabantu abanengi ngokungangothuli lomhlabathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.13.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 13:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akungiphe ukuhlakanipha lokuqedisisa ukuba ngibahole kuhle lababantu; ngoba ngubani ongabusa lababantu bakho abanengi kangaka na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wamphendula uSolomoni wathi: Ngoba lokhu bekusenhliziyweni yakho, ungacelanga impahla lenotho lodumo, lokuphila kwalabo abakuzondayo, futhi ungacelanga ukuphila isikhathi eside, kodwa uzicelele ukuhlakanipha lokwazi ukuze ubuse abantu bami engikwenze waba yinkosi yabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngiyakunika ukuhlakanipha lokwazi; ngizakukunika futhi lenotho lempahla lodumo, angazanga abe lakho amakhosi ayengaphambi kwakho, langayikuba lakho amakhosi akulandelayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebuyake uSolomoni evela eGibeyoni endaweni ephakemeyo yokukhonzela, ethenteni lokuhlangana, waya eJerusalema. Wabusa koIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
